# A list of devices you want to take the screenshots from
#
# No iPad support yet -- RootSplitViewController's column-display-mode
# handling isn't correct for iPad's uncollapsed split view (see the
# testTakeScreenshots() investigation), and NectarUITests.tapBackButton()
# assumes the single-nav-stack back button that only exists when the split
# view is collapsed. Without an explicit devices() list here, fastlane
# snapshot falls back to its own default device set, which includes iPads,
# so this is pinned to iPhone only. "iPhone 17" is also what CI's own
# xcodebuild -destination uses (.github/workflows/ci.yml), so it's a
# confirmed-available simulator name in this environment.
devices([
  "iPhone 17"
])

